Some files contain code copied or adapted from the tidyverse package, which is
distributed under the MIT License. Those tidyverse-derived portions remain
subject to the original MIT copyright and permission notice reproduced below.
These portions include both near-verbatim copies and modified adaptations that
replace tidyverse helpers with base-R equivalents.

The tidyverse source files reviewed for these attributions were taken from:
https://github.com/tidyverse/tidyverse/tree/0231aafbc56914ee5371dd6c7b60677f168d7154

MIT-licensed tidyverse-derived components:
- R/utils.R: wrapped_startup() and invert() adapted from tidyverse/R/utils.R;
  .same_library() adapted from tidyverse/R/attach.R; is_attached() adapted from
  tidyverse/R/zzz.R
- R/conflicts.R: stanflow_conflicts(), stanflow_conflict_message(),
  print.stanflow_conflicts(), confirm_conflict(), and ls_env() adapted from
  tidyverse/R/conflicts.R
- R/update.R: stanflow_deps() and stanflow_update() adapted from
  tidyverse/R/update.R
- R/load.R: core_attach_message(), message_packages(), .find_unloaded(), and
  .package_version_h() adapted from tidyverse/R/attach.R
- R/logo.R: stanflow_logo() adapted from tidyverse/R/logo.R
- R/zzz.R: .onAttach() adapted from tidyverse/R/zzz.R

